            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Agho naakoba mule nti: “Nfuuse muntu mukologho era omugezi einho, naasinga abo boonaboona abansooka okufuga mu Yerusalemu. Bwenebwene mboine ebintu kamaala, byandeetera okumanha n'okutegeera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neeghaayo inho nsobole okumanha okwawulagho amagezi n'eiralu, n'obusiru. Aye naabona nga kyona kiri ng'oti kubinga mpewo kugigema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
